{"sha": "51261d2550eb9d2416317b522699e41684a8f08cad9d32ad54bba904392cb114", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g5:decimalops} 章 --- 小数计算}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g5:decimalops:1}", "$45.7 + 8.93 = 54.63$; \\quad", "$16.25 + 3.75 = 20$; \\quad", "$0.86 + 12.4 = 13.26$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g5:decimalops:2}", "$9.4 - 2.72 = 6.68$（验算：$6.68 + 2.72 = 9.4$）。", "", "$20 - 13.45 = 6.55$（验算：$6.55 + 13.45 = 20$）。", "", "$6.03 - 5.9 = 0.13$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g5:decimalops:3}", "$6.2 \\to 10$: $3.8$. \\quad $3.75 \\to 10$: $6.25$. \\quad", "$9.99 \\to 10$: $0.01$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g5:decimalops:4}", "$72.4$; \\quad $58$; \\quad $3.45$; \\quad $0.07$; \\quad $300$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g5:decimalops:5}", "$4.05$ 米 $= 405$ 厘米；\\quad $325$ 厘米 $= 3.25$ 米；\\quad", "$0.6$ 千克 $= 600$ 克；\\quad $85$ 厘升 $= 0.85$ 升。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g5:decimalops:6}", "$6.2 \\times 4$：估算 $24$；精确值 $24.8$。", "", "$3.45 \\times 8$：估算 $28$（$3.5 \\times 8$）；精确值 $27.6$。", "", "$12.5 \\times 6$：估算 $75$；精确值 $75$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g5:decimalops:7}", "$7$ 圈：$0.4 \\times 7 = 2.8$ 千米。$25$ 圈：", "$0.4 \\times 25 = 10$ 千米。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g5:decimalops:8}", "法棍面包：$1.15 \\times 2 = 2.30$。总价：$2.30 + 12.60 = 14.90$。", "找零：$20 - 14.90 = 5.10$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g5:decimalops:9}", "一包：$1.5 \\times 6 = 9$ 升。每两天用 $0.75 + 0.75 = 1.5$ 升，", "因此 $9$ 升够用 $12$ 天（共十二份，每份 $0.75$ 升：", "$12 \\times 0.75 = 9$）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g5:decimalops:10}", "估算：$5.6$ 比 $5.5$ 大，而 $5.5 \\times 3 = 16.5$ --- 所以", "积必须\\emph{大于} $16.5$，而 $15.18$ 太", "小。正确计算：$56 \\times 3 = 168$，共一位小数，所以", "$5.6 \\times 3 = 16.8$。米洛把两个部分积（$15$ 和", "$18$）并排写在一起，而没有按数位相加：", "$15 + 1.8 = 16.8$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g5:decimalops:11}", "\\emph{1.} $65.4 + 64.9 + 65.0 + 66.1 = 261.4$ 秒。", "", "\\emph{2.} $261.4 > 260$：她没有破纪录；她", "比纪录多了 $1.4$ 秒。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}